### Mini-Service Pattern (WebSocket/Socket.io)

```typescript
// mini-services/[service]/index.ts
import { Server } from 'socket.io'

const PORT = 3005
const io = new Server(PORT, { cors: { origin: '*' } })

io.on('connection', (socket) => {
  socket.on('join:team', (teamId) => {
    socket.join(teamId)
  })
  // ... more events
})

console.log(`[service] Running on port ${PORT}`)
```

Frontend connects: `io('/?XTransformPort=3005')` - NEVER hardcode the URL.

### External API Integration Pattern (GitHub, Jira, etc.)

```typescript
// src/lib/[service].ts
export interface ServiceIssue { /* fields */ }

export async function listIssues(owner: string, repo: string, token: string) {
